      48.81,
      350.17,
      539.86,
      373.24
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 3 and 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I, Rishad Bathiudeen,Minister of Industry and Commerce, do by this notification.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.61,
      398.17,
      539.99,
      433.24
    ],
    "text": "01. Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201cMedical Administrators\u2019 Forum\u201d situated at Accidentand Othopaedic Services, National Hospital of Sri Lanka, Colombo 10 as a purpose to which the powers andfacilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.61,
      446.17,
      539.95,
      469.24
    ],
    "text": "02. Limit the application of that Ordinance to aforesaid society by exempting it from the provision of Section 5(4)of that Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
